// Throw Spirit Sphere impact (MO_FINGEROFFENSIVE): the spheres themselves fly
// from the caster as the `spirit_sphere` shader_fx projectile (reference
// EF_TANJI), one per hit; this is the blue ki burst on the victim, timed to
// land after a mid-range flight (~0.2s). ~0.55s.
// Coordinates follow inc_agi.strfx.ron: (319, 291) is the unit's feet, smaller
// y is higher, 1024 angle units per turn. The body spans about y 191..291.
